Hi,

after the BZR repositories for all the OpenPrinting software being back, 
but with a different upload mechanism, I have updated the contributor 
instructions:

https://www.linuxfoundation.org/collaborate/workgroups/openprinting/databaseinstructionsforcontributors

What has changed are the URLs and methods to access the repositories on 
our servers, the e-mail addresses to contact for getting write access or 
help in case of problems, and I have added the repositories for the 
Common Print Dialog and the new CUPS Filters package.

    Till
